<title>UK: Shell to supply styrene to BP.</title>
<headline>Shell to supply styrene to BP.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell Chemicals Europe Ltd said on Tuesday that it had signed a letter of intent to supply styrene to BP Chemicals Ltd's polystyrene plants in northern France.</p>
<p>Shell said in a statement that its plant at Moerdijk in the Netherlands would provide up to 250 kilotonnes of styrene monomer a year to the BP operations at Wingles on a long-term basis.</p>
<p>BP Chemicals said the agreement &quot;will provide a secure, competitive feedstock supply for our operations at Wingles.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
